    "answer": "A Record over EscalationTrigger gives the same compile-time guarantee as a switch with no default. If someone adds a trigger member without adding an entry, `npm run typecheck` fails. A switch that covered every member would exceed the lint complexity limit. So the fixture `apps/api/test/fixtures/escalationTriggers.ts` is a Record, checked by its `satisfies` clause, and it has been typechecked since #275.",
